{
  "title": "Reflex | Resource scheduler operations",
  "description": "Queue pressure, job outcomes, node CPU/memory reservations and guarded placements. Select one simulation_run and its historical time range. SDK panels have application scope.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "auto",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "defaults": [
        "local"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "application",
      "prefix": "service",
      "defaults": [
        "reflex"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "policy",
      "prefix": "policy",
      "defaults": [
        "jev"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "run",
      "prefix": "simulation_run",
      "defaults": [
        "*"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Resource scheduling\nSelect an environment, application, policy and **simulation run**, then the matching time range. Run `*` combines tagged runs; select one run for capacity and queue interpretation. Scheduler run tags are enabled with `--datadog-evidence`.\nCPU and memory show **reserved capacity**, not measured utilization. Jobs are counted when completed or rejected; placement attempts can repeat for the same queued job. Rates use wall time; job durations use simulation time (aligned at 1\u00d7). Missing telemetry is not interpreted as free capacity.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Outcomes \u2014 selected time range",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "show_title": true,
        "background_color": "blue",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "id": 2,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Completed jobs",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:scheduler.jobs{$env AND $application AND $policy AND $run AND outcome:completed}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 3,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Rejected arrivals",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:scheduler.jobs{$env AND $application AND $policy AND $run AND outcome:rejected}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 4,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Successful placements",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:scheduler.placements{$env AND $application AND $policy AND $run AND outcome:placed}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 5,
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Deferred placement attempts",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "q1",
                      "query": "sum:scheduler.placements{$env AND $application AND $policy AND $run AND outcome:deferred}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "q1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "precision": 0,
              "autoscale": true
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
